cefbrowser Debian source package
================================

The packaging branch is based on Zabrimus/cefbrowser upstream commit
681c63a779f84fa16a247bd032ff0332d2c3620f.

Launchpad builders must not download CEF or Meson wrap dependencies during the
package build.  Run packaging/prepare-orig.sh before creating the source
package.  The helper creates a source tree containing the checksum-verified CEF
126.2.7 minimal runtime and all Meson wrap subprojects, plus a matching
.orig.tar.xz without debian/.

The actual dpkg-buildpackage/debuild invocation must therefore run from the
prepared source tree.  Network access during dh_auto_configure or dh_auto_build
is a packaging bug.

Licensing note
--------------

The CEF redistribution licence is shipped as subprojects/License.cef.txt.
The Zabrimus cefbrowser repository itself currently has no project-wide licence
file or explicit redistribution licence.  The package can be developed and
built for testing, but public PPA publication must wait for explicit upstream
redistribution terms or separate Launchpad approval.
